  "intro": {
    "title": "Am Montag",
    "paragraphs": [
      "All seven days are masculine, and all but Mittwoch end in -tag. To say 'on Monday' use am: am Montag, am Freitag.",
      "Add an -s and write it small and you get a habit: montags means 'on Mondays', every week. The week in Germany starts on Monday."
    ]
  },
